    "detail": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\"><div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\"><div class=\"detailmodule_image\">\n <img style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S755169105b39432f8c7f35e0afb87a87J.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;line-height:28px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>HOCHWERTIGES MATERIAL</strong></span></p>\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Hergestellt aus transparentem und umweltfreundlichem PP-Kunststoff, hochwertig, stark und langlebig.Unsere Produkte wurden streng gepr&uuml;ft.Damit Sie ein hochwertiges Einkaufserlebnis genie&szlig;en k&ouml;nnen</span></p>\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;line-height:28px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>ANDERE GR&Ouml;SSEN</strong></span></p>\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Sie k&ouml;nnen zwischen mehr als 7 Aufbewahrungsboxenstilen w&auml;hlen. Verschiedene Gr&ouml;&szlig;en k&ouml;nnen Ihren unterschiedlichen Anforderungen gerecht werden.</span></p>\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;line-height:28px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>EINFACH ZU VERWENDEN</strong></span></p>\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Einfach zu lagern und zu verwalten. Kleine Accessoires, Ohrringe, Ringe, Halsketten, Schn&uuml;re, Perlen; Haken, K&ouml;der; Alphabetbrett-Alphabet, DIY-Bastelarbeiten, N&auml;gel, Muttern und Schrauben usw.</span></p>\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;line-height:28px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>VERSCHIEDENE ANWENDUNGEN</strong></span></p>\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:14px;font-weight:300;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Sehr gut geeignet zur Aufbewahrung von Diamanten, Samen, Perlen, Nagel-Strasssteinen, Pillen, Ohrsteckern, Ringen und anderen kleinen Gegenst&auml;nden.</span></p>\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_image\">\n <img style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S9769620ac74a420dbcedfd8433873105Y.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sbcbf0d7f4be54bba95fb6361cf8e2796q.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sbc4049fe6771422fb7a18b58f9b3a7abh.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sa8a811611dc7498a8757613e7dbf5c05Q.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sfd5a0c41ef824b978ec78ca1f32a8fcaA.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sea4ad82ad1c84aafac81584dadabef7fa.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S04c3106563bf46f897226c079284583dO.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sdc53f04051c0411e8a9514e36c4015a4s.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Safdd01cc3ea54f5381404f6322ea1ca8o.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S8ff2507f9ed94ab9b0bc6b7a2b8d492cZ.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_image\">\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1is.KcoCF3KVjSZJnq6znHFXaP.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n <p style=\"font-family:OpenSans;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;line-height:28px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);margin-bottom:12px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\">Verpackungsschritt</p>\n</div><div class=\"detailmodule_image\">\n <img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB160oKcgKG3KVjSZFLq6yMvXXaR.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S53f0edaa20814fef96bbe20698ce19c5Q.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Se0027ce81cf546788296d300ad546705d.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n <img style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S0f794139f88d48b89e516bd6dc4c0f3cW.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" />\n</div><p><br /></p></div></div>\r\n"
